# Anchored with a leading ** since these live under vinu-components/, not
# the repo root -- a bare "data/models/" only matches <root>/data/models/
# and was silently not matching, letting multi-GB model downloads and
# throwaway venvs show up as untracked instead of being ignored.
**/data/simulator/simulations/
**/data/models/

